    "regime_notes": "Daily signal clears the benchmark paper IC and ICIR gates across 2,704 dates and an average 13.37 of 15 tradable instruments. Ten-day predictive power is negative, so use as a short-horizon diversifying component rather than a standalone ten-day forecast. Early/middle/late 1-day regime split was not separately persisted; the 10-day split was -0.02505/+0.00499/+0.00676, indicating horizon dependence.",
